WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,830
Brother, look, they are so strong

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:04,830
Zhao Xiuni, can you please say goodbye to Brother Chengtian?

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:05,830
My brother wants you to talk more.

4
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:08,830
When you die, you will be just like his trash. You won't be able to survive more than three days.

5
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:12,020
This is in someone's car

6
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,020
There are only a few of us left

7
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:16,020
Live well, husband

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:21,500
No wonder he became a loner in his previous life

9
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,500
We are leading a children's group

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,570
There is a car there, you can get off here

11
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:29,040
You guys are going to the barracks

12
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,040
Go straight along this road and turn right

13
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,040
Be careful yourselves

14
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,040
But the part where you turned right collapsed.

15
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,815
It can only be no

16
00:00:35,815 --> 00:00:42,060
It's about three hundred meters to dig.
